  "body": "Positioned in one of the North Shore’s most sought-after coastal communities, this home enjoys all that Torbay and Waiake have to offer. Here, the location is every bit as appealing as the home itself.\r\n\r\nDesigned with premium family living in mind, it combines generous space, captivating sea views, solid construction and an easy-care lifestyle. Spacious, welcoming and filled with genuine warmth, this is a home where you can settle in, spread out and enjoy the very best of coastal living.\r\n\r\nThe versatile layout offers two generous and separate living areas on the upper level, complemented by a spacious, well-appointed kitchen, master bedroom and additional double bedroom and family bathroom with separate toilet. The formal lounge, complete with cosy fireplace, opens onto expansive decking and a conservatory, creating the perfect setting to follow the sun while enjoying stunning views across the Hauraki Gulf to Rangitoto Island.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, you’ll discover a further bedroom with ensuite, a separate office, laundry and an expansive living area that flows effortlessly to an enclosed sun deck and additional outdoor decking. This level offers wonderful flexibility, with the potential to create a self-contained space for extended family or guests. Internal garaging, along with generous off-street parking for the boat and visitors, completes the picture.\r\n\r\nEmbrace the Coastal Lifestyle – just a short stroll to local beaches, schools and reserves, this is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy the relaxed Torbay and Waiake way of life. Whether you’re looking for room for a growing family, space for extended family or simply a home that offers an easy-care lifestyle, this property delivers on so many levels.",
